[gd_scene load_steps=12 format=3 uid="uid://wardbfixdisp001"]

; Wall-mounted medication dispenser. Canonical size 0.55W x 0.75H x 0.16D,
; origin at the centre of the volume, faceplate faces -Z. Composite so it
; reads as a fixture rather than a flat wall panel (see godot/MIGRATION_NOTES.md
; and src/game/world.ts:637 for why a plain box fails against the plaster
; shaders): dark body, a cream faceplate with a cross + MEDICATION text, a
; recessed amber-glow dispensing slot, and a tray lip below it. Warm amber is
; the dispenser's accent colour, distinct from the keypad's cool cyan, so the
; two never read as the same fixture from across a dim room.
;
; Visuals only — no collision, no gameplay script. The room generator supplies
; the Area3D + CollisionShape3D this gets instanced under.

